the pile foundation replacement construction technology and shield tunneling underpass construction have the greatest
impact in the first layer of factors. The original bridge pier and the connection between the bearing platform and the
replacement beam have the greatest impact in the second layer of factors. The risk assessment results are in accord with
the engineering practice. Based on the assessment results, key control and full process monitoring measurements are
implemented for the pile foundation replacement construction. The applicability and reliability of risk assessment method
are verified by the monitoring results.
Keywords: shield tunnel; pile foundation group crossing; fuzzy analytic hierarchy process; grey correlation analysis; risk
